  m_Name: Carta_RequalificacaoUrbana
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Requalifica\xE7\xE3o Urbana"
  _titleEn: Urban Regeneration
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Requalificar \xE9 recuperar \xE1reas degradadas, como antigos portos,
    viadutos e f\xE1bricas, e devolv\xEA-las ao uso das pessoas."
  _summaryEn: Regeneration means recovering run-down areas, such as old ports, overpasses
    and factories, and giving them back to people.
  _realWorld: "Seul demoliu um viaduto e reabriu o c\xF3rrego Cheonggyecheon em 2005,
    criando um parque linear no centro e reduzindo a temperatura do entorno."
  _realWorldEn: Seoul tore down an elevated highway and reopened the Cheonggyecheon
    stream in 2005, creating a linear park downtown and lowering nearby temperatures.
  _tradeOffs: "As obras s\xE3o caras, e a valoriza\xE7\xE3o pode expulsar os moradores
    e comerciantes que estavam l\xE1 antes."
  _tradeOffsEn: The works are expensive, and rising values can push out the residents
    and shops that were there before.
  _sources:
  - Label: Cheonggyecheon (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheonggyecheon
